# Sentinel — client build environment. Copy to `client/.env` (or set in your host).
#
# Leave EMPTY for a single-origin deploy (backend serves the built client).
# For a SPLIT deploy (frontend and backend on different hosts), set this to the
# backend's public URL so every /api/* call is routed there:
#
#   VITE_API_BASE=https://sentinel-api.onrender.com
#
VITE_API_BASE=
